------------------------ Role and user Mapping ---------------
 
 
Map Users and Roles by taking out GRANT commands from Backup.
 
 
Cross-verify with following :
 
 
SELECT
    u.usename AS "User",
    STRING_AGG(r.rolname, ', ') AS "Roles"
FROM
    pg_user u
JOIN
    pg_auth_members m ON (u.usesysid = m.member)
JOIN
    pg_roles r ON (m.roleid = r.oid)
GROUP BY
    u.usename;
 
